alse, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T04:29:38Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Pavan 10", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T04:29:54Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Love the idea of how a young boy in Punjab had such an amazing world view", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T04:30:00Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Next", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T04:30:02Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "In that time", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T04:30:29Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Tabhi including the anecdotes or excerpts from his prison diary along with", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T04:30:37Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "It's just wonderful", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T04:30:39Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Next", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T04:30:44Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "2. When Bhagat Singh and his comrades appeared in court on January 21, 1930, they sent a telegram to the Third International. This is perhaps his most direct public tribute:\n\"On X Day we send hearty greetings to all who are doing something for carrying forward the ideas of the great X. We wish success to the great experiment ______ is carrying out. We join our voice to that of the international working class movement. The proletariat will win. Capitalism will be defeated. Death to Imperialism.” Id X", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03